   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ICRC OPERATION IN MOZAMBIQUE 2024 - JAN TO DEC</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The assistence programme in Northern Mozambique focuses on providing urgent humanitarian aid to conflict-affected people. Key priorities include ensuring respect for International humanitarian law, securing access to essential services and livelihood opportunities, visiting detainees, reconnecting separated families, enhancing local forensic capacities, and strengthening the Mozambique Red Cross Society&apos;s ability to restore family links and respond to emergencies.</narrative>
  </description>
